  "description": "From [Rose Squad Scans](https://www.mangaupdates.com/groups.html?id=42931927880):  \nMy guardian is an incubus?! Because he didn't wish to receive his sinnaerim (T/N: his personal gods for practicing Shamanism) a high school boy attempted to call a greater God but summoned a demon instead. Among the demons, he summoned a demon of lust, an incubus and this is the pure(?) story of the guardianship of the high schooler by the demon.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53086874), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4631000175)",
